      "title": "MySQL: Assume a minimal set of capability flags",
      "message": "MySQL: Assume a minimal set of capability flags\n\nThis is in case there is no login/greeting because we start in the\nmiddle of a conversation.\n\nA bit more guessing is needed for MYSQL_CAPS_QA unfortunately.\n",
